In pl9, I had Stormbringer, died, got it again, died and got it once more. When
I got to the bones level with my current SB, the trolls on that bones level 
had found it and was using it to attack me. It was dropping my life levels as
if it were SB! When I finally killed the troll (and ate it *burp* :-) (excuse me)), I
looked at the sword and it was a "normal" sword (unnamed) but had the
same abilities. I haven't found SB in pl10 so I can't tell you about that.

So, from my experience I would say that there can only be one SB but there
can be two with the same powers (bug??).

